		PRINTFORMDL Her hair flows over her cheeks and seems to sparkle in the \@ TIME:2 < 5 ? sunlight # moonlight \@.
		PRINTFORML 「I live here in this forest... Are you lost, by perchance?」
		PRINTFORML 「It's dangerous to wander around here alone.」
		PRINTFORMDL She speaks words of concern for your well-being as she smiles softly.
		;custom code
		IF CFLAG:K17C_ID:1092
			PRINTFORMDL "Even if this forest is dangerous, it can't be all that bad if it means I can meet such a beautiful girl as you."
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL Even if this forest is dangerous, you think it can't be that bad if it means you can meet such a beautiful girl as this.
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORML 「...」
		PRINTW
		PRINTFORML 「...That's a rather casual attitude towards someone you just met, isn't it?」
		PRINTFORMDL Though she averts her gaze as she says this, she looks a little embarrassed.
		PRINTFORML 「Be careful not to be misled by a bad witch, okay?」
		;custom code
		IF CFLAG:K17C_ID:1092
			PRINTFORMDL "Oh, are there any such witches around here?"
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL You ask if she knows of any such witches around here, in jest.
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORML 「Fufu, you never know.」
		PRINTW
	
	;魔法の森が自宅の場合で拠点で会った　とりあえず仮置き
	ELSEIF MAIN_MAP == 5 && INRANGE(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置,500,599)
			
		PRINTFORML 「%K17_CNAME()%, are you by chance the one who moved in recently?」
		PRINTFORMDL You see a Western-looking woman in front of you, a rare sight in Gensokyo.
		PRINTFORMDL She gracefully draws a milky white hand through her golden hair.
		PRINTFORMDL Her hair flows over her cheeks and seems to sparkle in the \@ TIME:2 < 5 ? sunlight # moonlight \@.
		PRINTFORMDL You wonder if it would be rude to liken her to an exquisitely crafted doll.
		PRINTFORMDL In any case, she almost looks too perfect.
		PRINTW
		PRINTFORML 「Have you been having any difficulties?」
		PRINTFORML 「If so, please let me know right away. Ignoring a problem will only make it worse.」
		PRINTFORMDL She speaks words of concern for your well-being as she smiles softly.
		;自室
		IF CFLAG:K17C_ID:現在位置 == CFLAG:K17C_ID:初期位置
			PRINTFORML 「Also, a lot of things here are dangerous for an amateur to touch, so please don't enter without permission.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「This place is especially dangerous, so please be careful.」
		ENDIF
		;custom code
		IF CFLAG:K17C_ID:1092
			PRINTFORMDL "Even so, if I can meet such a beautiful girl as you, it's worth the risk."
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL Even if it's dangerous, it can't be all that bad if it means you can meet such a beautiful girl as this.
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORML 「...」
		PRINTW
		PRINTFORML 「...That's a rather casual attitude to take towards someone you just met, isn't it?」
		PRINTFORMDL Though she averts her gaze as she says this, you catch a hint of red on her cheeks.
		PRINTFORML 「Do be careful not to be led astray by a wicked witch.」
		;custom code
		IF CFLAG:K17C_ID:1092
			PRINTFORMDL "Oh, are there any such witches around here?"
