			CFLAG:K17C_ID:K17C_CF_上海好感度+=20
			PRINTFORMDL You touch the dolls' hands with your finger and introduce yourself.
			PRINTW
			PRINTFORMDL The excellently made dolls seem to laugh as they swing their arms about in exaggerated motions.
			PRINTFORMDL And that puppeteer's skills are the real deal.
			PRINTFORMDL You continue watching the doll performance for a while.
