			PRINTFORMDL When the crowd temporarily thins, the puppeteer girl suddenly smiles.
			PRINTFORMDL Raising the edges of her skirt, she curtsies politely to you in greeting.
			PRINTFORMDL You applaud before her charming figure.
			PRINTW
		ENDIF
		
