	IF CFLAG:K17C_ID:1092
		PRINTFORMDL "They're very well-crafted. It almost feels like they're alive."
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDL You compliment her on how well-crafted they are, such that they almost feel like they're alive.
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORML 「I'm honored by your words. I made them myself.」
	;custom code
	IF CFLAG:K17C_ID:1092
		PRINTFORMDL "So you manipulate them with those...strands of light? Extending from your fingers."
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDL Are those puppet strings extending from her fingers like strands of light? You try asking her.
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORML 「A magician never reveals her secrets.」
	PRINTFORMDL As %CALLNAME:TARGET% introduces herself with composure, it's clear she's proud of both her magical ability and puppeteering technique.
	PRINTFORMDL And you feel an air of defiance, as well.
	PRINTL	
	;preliminary for choices, consider changing if it doesn't fit your style
	PRINTFORMDL After getting to meet Alice like this, you feel...
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDL [0]Excited to see what happens next
	PRINTFORMDL [1]You'd want to see her be a bit more straightforward
	PRINTFORMDL [2]You'd want to see her maintain her dignity and stay as proud as she is
	PRINTFORMDL [3]Please explain these choices
	$OPENING_INPUT_LOOP1
	INPUT
	PRINTL
	SELECTCASE RESULT
		CASE 0
			CFLAG:K17C_ID:K17C_CF_素質変化フラグ = 0
			PRINTFORMDL You're looking forward to getting to know her better.
			PRINTW
		CASE 1
			CFLAG:K17C_ID:K17C_CF_素質変化フラグ = 1
			PRINTFORMDL You're looking forward to getting to know her and seeing her be more candid with you going forward.
			PRINTW
		CASE 2
			CFLAG:K17C_ID:K17C_CF_素質変化フラグ = -1
			PRINTFORMDL If you ever get to know each other, you're sure she'll remain as proud and dignified as she is right now.
			PRINTW
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORMDL [0]-Select this, and Alice will be kept as she is, this can be changed via UPDATE
			PRINTFORMDL [1]-Select this, and Alice's traits will change depending on your subsequent actions
			PRINTFORMDL [2]-Select this, and Alice's traits will remain as they are
			PRINTFORMDL The initial stages of the dialogue won't change much regardless of which you choose.
			PRINTFORMDL Think of it as a change in the level of difficulty to progress.
			;PRINTFORMDL どっちにしろ恋慕がつけばデレる
			GOTO OPENING_INPUT_LOOP1
		CASEELSE
			GOTO OPENING_INPUT_LOOP1
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
RETURN 1



