				PRINTFORMDL She falls silent, and you're not sure if she's searching for her next words, or waiting for your response.
				PRINTFORMDL %CALLNAME:TARGET% simply continues to wordlessly clutch your sleeve.
				PRINTW
				SELECTCASE iRT
					CASE IS >= K17C_恋慕
						PRINTFORML 「So... Please go steady with me...」
						PRINTFORMDL She looks you straight in the eyes as she confesses to you.
						PRINTFORMW 「I... I love you...」
						PRINTFORML 「I can't imagine living without you anymore...」
						
					CASE IS >= K17C_思慕
						PRINTFORML 「So... Please go out with me...」
						CALL HPH_PRINT,@"「...%K17_CNAME()%... I...l-like youBPBBPBBPB」", "W"
						PRINTFORMDL She confesses to you with a frail voice while blushing furiously.
						PRINTFORML 「%K17_CNAME()%, please take responsibility for this, okay...?」
				ENDSELECT
