						PRINTDATAL
							DATAFORM 「I'm okay cooking for you every day.」
							DATAFORM 「And... I'm even fine doing adult things with you every day.」
							DATAFORM 「I want to wake up every morning next to you...」
							DATAFORM 「I always want to be by your side, anytime, anywhere, forever.」
						ENDDATA
